{{cit|t|a}}

== Effect ==
* Occasionally causes Isaac to blend into the ground, which briefly [[confusion|confuses]] all enemies in the room.
** Effect can only trigger every 10 seconds on the timer.
* {{dlc+|r}} Can be used to open {{achievement|A Strange Door}} instead of {{I|The Polaroid}} or {{I|The Negative}}, destroying the trinket in the process.{{dlc-}}

== Notes ==
* Confusion is only applied when Isaac begins fading into the background. Any enemy that spawns while Isaac is already faded won't be confused until Isaac fades in, then out again.
* {{dlc+|r}} Faded Polaroid has the highest priority to open the Strange Door, and will always be taken first if Isaac is holding multiple items that open it.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Faded Polaroid cannot open the Strange Door if it was consumed by [[Gulp!|"Gulp!" pill]], {{I|Marbles}}, or {{I|Smelter}}.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{I|Mom's Box}} / {{t|Faded Polaroid|r}}: Each trinket copy stacks, lengthening the duration of the confusion and visual effect per stack.

