== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|r}} Faded Polaroid being used to open the Strange Door is a nod to a mechanic in the original ''Binding of Isaac: Wrath of The Lamb'' flash game, where {{I|The Polaroid}} was a trinket in that game and was required to access the {{s|Chest}} after beating {{s|Cathedral}}.

